## 9. Do not build

- Swipe, votes, results, force-results.
- Accounts or auth. Names are per-session and disposable.
- A "leave session" button for participants. Presence handles departures.
- Any entry point on the shelf. Still shipping dark.
- Changes to `index.html`, `js/filters.js`, or `games.json`.

